#. <CLT 4>モノクマが写るモニター…
#. うっとうしいモニターだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is one of the monitors Monokuma appears on. I\n"
"hate this thing...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はあ……
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんなカメラで監視されてるなんて…
#. まるっきり悪夢だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Being constantly watched like this... It's a total\n"
"nightmare.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時計があって時間はわかるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a clock telling me what time it is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>外が見えないんじゃ、
#. それが正しいのかもわからないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I can't see outside, so I have no idea if it's\n"
"even right.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0006 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0007 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
